=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ BZIP2 @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt bzip2 @VERSION@ for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt bzip2 is free software under a BSD-style licence; see LICENSE.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [BZIP2.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for bzip2
    At system startup: to define BZIP2$ROOT at every boot, add this line to
    SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:BZIP2$STARTUP.COM
    For each user: to define the commands, add this line to LOGIN.COM:
    $ @BZIP2$ROOT:[000000]BZIP2$SETUP.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE BZIP2 removes the product and deassigns BZIP2$ROOT.
